41430::$$$message_0297_0000_0000$$$::"Now, Caster.[br]The character artist said, 'she has a lot of expressions and it was rough working on her...'"::
41431::$$$message_0297_0001_0000$$$::"...That's true.[br]There's a huge gap between the way she is now and the way she was in FSN."::
41432::$$$message_0297_0002_0000$$$::"Relatively speaking...[br][cacheimage storage=アーチャー神主01d(中)b,凛巫女服01i(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=アーチャー神主01d(中)b,凛巫女服01i(中)][shock vmax=20 time=500 count=15] she's a tsunderererererererererepiki, now."::
41433::$$$message_0297_0003_0000$$$::"Piki? As in angry?"::
41434::$$$message_0297_0004_0000$$$::"Piki."0ȞY